# AMVTF Engines

## Fusion (`amvtf.py`)

With target profile: `0.40 acoustic + 0.35 identity + 0.25 context`  
Without target: human-heavy → context-weighted; synthetic-heavy → acoustic-weighted

Verdicts:

- authenticity < 50 → CRITICAL / TERMINATE
- context ≥ 70 or fused ≥ 60 → CRITICAL / TERMINATE
- context ≥ 38 or fused ≥ 35 or identity mismatch → WARNING / STEP_UP
- else SAFE / ALLOW

## AASIST (`aasist.py`)

- Decode mono 16 kHz; heuristics (jitter, STFT hi ratio, kurtosis, etc.)
- Live path may use `trained_live_classifier.joblib` if present
- `calibrated_thresholds.json` may exist unused — wire carefully if enabling

## ECAPA (`ecapa.py`)

- Embedding from FFT/mel-style projection; cosine similarity 0–100
- Match threshold default ~70; store vectors on `voice_profiles`

## NLP (`nlp.py`)

- Google ASR + `THREAT_DICTIONARY` / category weights (OTP, UPI, digital arrest, etc.)
- Hindi + English locale awareness matters for this product

## Spectrogram (`spectrogram.py`)

- STFT PNG base64 `data_url` + metadata for forensic UI
